From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:26:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 71/71] box: a test of what a program that embeds this sing-box
 relies on

podkop-experimental builds this sing-box into its backend, and calls what the fork adds to
upstream's API (podkop-engine's docs/EMBEDDING.md). A change that broke it was seen when that program
moved to it. The test builds a configuration with every option it writes, the way "sing-box check"
does, and runs a box as it does: a start with RemoteStart and StartWithoutClose, its own service,
log writer and connection tracker, the rule sets and their update, FakeIP's Peek, the traffic and
the detector's flows, the ways of the downloads, a copy of an outbound for a probe and the outcome
of the handshakes under DetectOutcomeKey, UpdateOutbounds, the Clash API of a URL test, the readers
of rule-set files and links, and the texts it goes by.

A patch of its own (0802), for the series as a whole.

Pdk-Feature: embedder-test
Pdk-Zone: other
Pdk-Layer: 08
